TOKEN tinybird_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
    Google Analytics Data API responses for the retired pollinations.ai GA4 property 277369924
    (tag G-LPZ9GEJVHR), copied once before the old Google Workspace goes away. One row per
    dataset, calendar month and start_row, body as returned. Datasets: traffic (day, source,
    medium, campaign, country, device), hosts (day, site, country). No page paths. row_count
    is GA's total for the report, so a month is complete when its bodies hold row_count rows.

SCHEMA >
    `dataset` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.dataset`,
    `start_date` Date `json:$.start_date`,
    `end_date` Date `json:$.end_date`,
    `start_row` UInt32 `json:$.start_row`,
    `row_count` UInt32 `json:$.row_count`,
    `fetched_at` DateTime `json:$.fetched_at`,
    `body` String `json:$.body`

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "dataset, start_date, start_row, fetched_at"
